item.description:
You can manage relationships between resources using the `PATCH` methods.
Relationships can be either **to-one** (a single related resource) or **to-many** (multiple related resources).

> **Important**
>
> - Use `PATCH` to replace or remove relationships.
> - Servers may return **403 Forbidden** if complete replacement is not allowed.

---

## Updating to-one relationships

Use a `PATCH` request to update a to-one relationship.

*Update an inbound trunk for a DID*

This request updates the inbound trunk assigned to a DID:

**Request**

```
 1PATCH /v3/dids/f10d40c7-fd0b-4d63-bb9b-27810a1a8f5c HTTP/1.1
 2Host: api.didww.com
 3Content-Type: application/vnd.api+json
 4Accept: application/vnd.api+json
 5
 6{
 7  "data": {
 8    "type": "dids",
 9    "id": "f10d40c7-fd0b-4d63-bb9b-27810a1a8f5c",
10    "relationships": {
11      "voice_in_trunk": {
12        "data": { "type": "voice_in_trunks", "id": "d9b6ec47-0b72-452b-b4b4-23dd9d5be7e6" }
13      }
14    }
15  }
16}
```

*Remove an inbound trunk from a DID*

This request clears the inbound trunk relationship by setting it to `null`:

**Request**

```
 1PATCH /v3/dids/f10d40c7-fd0b-4d63-bb9b-27810a1a8f5c HTTP/1.1
 2Host: api.didww.com
 3Content-Type: application/vnd.api+json
 4Accept: application/vnd.api+json
 5
 6{
 7  "data": {
 8    "type": "dids",
 9    "id": "1e0c45b1-1fea-4552-b41b-ffa9f5eb44c5",
10    "relationships": {
11      "voice_in_trunk": {
12        "data": null
13      }
14    }
15  }
16}
```

---

## Updating to-many relationships

Use `PATCH` to replace all members of a to-many relationship or clear them.

*Replace all inbound trunks in an inbound trunk group*

**Request**

```
 1PATCH /v3/voice_in_trunk_groups/714e8148-0aea-4cb6-8680-bd1d06453418 HTTP/1.1
 2Host: api.didww.com
 3Content-Type: application/vnd.api+json
 4Accept: application/vnd.api+json
 5
 6{
 7  "data": {
 8    "id": "714e8148-0aea-4cb6-8680-bd1d06453418",
 9    "type": "voice_in_trunk_groups",
10    "relationships": {
11      "voice_in_trunks": {
12        "data": [
13          { "type": "voice_in_trunks", "id": "ca7da6d0-aa0b-447d-8fc0-1bc58b51298c"},
14          { "type": "voice_in_trunks", "id": "e9c1b7e9-253b-46c8-b7e9-5a930ab594c5" }
15        ]
16      }
17    }
18  }
19}
```

*Clear all inbound trunks in an inbound trunk group*

**Request**

```
 1PATCH /v3/voice_in_trunk_groups/c07815fc-bf9e-4cbf-a3fc-9c99b8de14d8 HTTP/1.1
 2Host: api.didww.com
 3Content-Type: application/vnd.api+json
 4Accept: application/vnd.api+json
 5
 6{
 7  "data": {
 8    "id": "c07815fc-bf9e-4cbf-a3fc-9c99b8de14d8",
 9    "type": "voice_in_trunk_groups",
10    "relationships": {
11      "voice_in_trunks": {
12        "data": []
13      }
14    }
15  }
16}
```

